description:
The screenshot shoots while when the top bar is closed but the top-bar animation that replaces the top bar with the clock / icons is not necessarily finished:

![image](/uploads/3697d63b51a46d23cca6fc073a62f22b/image.png){width=900 height=40}

Since the animation is driven by a revealer we need to wait til the animation time for that reveal animation is over. Given that we need the actual fold point in time in other places of the shell I think it's best to hardcode the reveal duration in the plugin for the moment (allowing this to query via shell -> home or walking the widget tree or introducing a 2nd signal looks like too much). 

@cynosure6 could you have a look? Worst case we'll disable building the quick setting for 0.59 but it would be great to have it fixed.
